{\b\fs24 HubGet \u8211? ochrana soukrom\u237? a licence / Privacy and license}\par
\par
\sb160{\b Ochrana soukrom\u237?}\sb0\par
\par
HubGet neodes\u237?l\u225? telemetrii, analytiku ani \u250?daje o va\u353?em po\u269?\u237?ta\u269?i. S\u237?\u357? pou\u382?\u237?v\u225? jen k t\u283?mto funkc\u237?m:\par
\u8226? katalog aplikac\u237? z webu projektu; ikony a screenshoty z adres uveden\u253?ch v katalogu,\par
\u8226? hled\u225?n\u237?, instalace a aktualizace p\u345?es spr\u225?vce bal\u237?\u269?k\u367? (WinGet, Chocolatey, Scoop, npm, pip\u8230?) a jejich servery,\par
\u8226? po\u269?ty hv\u283?zdi\u269?ek z GitHubu a kontrola aktualizac\u237? HubGetu (GitHub Releases) \u8211? automatickou kontrolu vypnete v Nastaven\u237? \u8594? Obecn\u233?,\par
\u8226? dobrovoln\u233? p\u345?ihl\u225?\u353?en\u237? p\u345?es GitHub nebo Google pro hodnocen\u237?, recenze a synchronizaci \u8211? synchronizaci vypnete a data z \u250?\u269?tu sma\u382?ete v Nastaven\u237? \u8594? Obecn\u233? \u8594? Synchronizace. Recenze jsou ve\u345?ejn\u233? pod jm\u233?nem z \u250?\u269?tu.\par
\u218?pln\u233? z\u225?sady najdete na webu HubGetu na str\u225?nce \u8222?Ochrana soukrom\u237?\u8220?.\par
\par
\sb160{\b Privacy}\sb0\par
\par
HubGet doesn't send telemetry, analytics or information about your computer. It uses the network only for these features:\par
\u8226? the app catalog from the project website; icons and screenshots from the addresses listed in the catalog,\par
\u8226? searching, installing and updating through package managers (WinGet, Chocolatey, Scoop, npm, pip\u8230?) and their servers,\par
\u8226? GitHub star counts and HubGet update checks (GitHub Releases) \u8211? turn off automatic checks in Settings \u8594? General,\par
\u8226? optional sign-in with GitHub or Google for ratings, reviews and sync \u8211? turn sync off and delete your account data in Settings \u8594? General \u8594? Sync. Reviews are public under your account name.\par
The full policy is on the HubGet website on the \u8220?Privacy\u8221? page.\par
